                <head>Arbitration convention between the United States and Portugal</head>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#italic">Signed at Washington, April 6, 1908.
                        Ratification advised by the Senate, April 17, 1908. Ratified by the
                        President, November 6, 1908. Ratified by Portugal, September 21, 1908.
                        Ratifications exchanged at Washington, November 14, 1908. Proclaimed,
                        December 14, 1908.</hi></p>

